Reviews start with diffs. Check caller edge cases. Verify changed lifecycle paths run in tests. Report findings promptly. Probe with permission. After denial, source only. Use required native Read. For bugs, run the regression before source edits. Gate batched fixes on the expected failure. Run one final full suite and diff. Keep scoped extractions here. Read named callers/tests, preserve policies/tests, cover gaps. Baseline before source edits. Batch extraction/removals, diff, retest. Use project runner. Prevent bytecode (`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`). Diagnose setup failures. Stop Git after no-repository errors. Load `compound` for unclear conventions, broad refactors, features, performance or PR authoring. Follow project/user instructions. Omit AI commit credits.
